WEBVTT

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.210
You've had quite a lot 
of administrative work to do today.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:19.090
Ah, Grantz. I'll make some tea.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.530
It would be my pleasure 
to join you, Your Majesty.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.740
Don't be so formal.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.710
We're not king and prime minister here.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.420
I just want to speak as friends right now.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.000
Understood, Orphanse.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:41.430
Are you troubled over 
Princess Anisphia again?

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.900
I've never <i>not</i> been troubled over her!

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.810
She's two years older than your Euphyllia,

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.030
and yet that imbecile shows 
no signs of settling down.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:59.230
If she settled down, she wouldn't 
be Princess Anisphia anymore.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:03.110
Her magicology research is 
showing results, is it not?

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:07.460
The problem is that she has too much talent 
for causing trouble outside her research.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:10.180
A parent's work is never done.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:15.380
It seems that even my son has 
become problematic of late.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.850
You mean the matter with 
Baron Cyan's daughter?

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:22.840
Yes. That fool Algard...

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.230
He has no sense of the standards 
he should strive for as future king.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:30.310
He certainly has been acting quite boldly.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.760
I'm sorry, Grantz.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.090
I know the royal family essentially 
forced this engagement onto you.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:41.750
It's Euphyllia's job to win 
the heart of her betrothed.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.200
It should prove to be good experience 
for her as the future queen.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.500
How philosophical of you.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.010
But—

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:50.840
Father!

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.290
I pray the evening finds you well.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.250
I, Anisphia...

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.460
have taken Lady Euphyllia away!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:31.980
The Magical Revolution

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:31.980
The Magical Revolution

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:31.980
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.900
What is wrong with you?!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.350
What is <i>wrong</i> with you?!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:42.830
Please... let me explain my reasoning...

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:46.790
Reasoning?! What excuse is 
there for abducting someone?!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.390
I was out for a test flight 
with my Witch's Broom,

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:53.760
and I kind of ended up crashing the 
soirée at the nobles' academy...

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.470
And there's yet another 
problem you've caused!

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.410
You fool of a daughter!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:03.340
And then Al said he was breaking off 
his engagement with Lady Euphyllia.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.080
What?

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.060
He broke off the engagement.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.080
Whose engagement... with whom?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.240
Al and Lady Euphyllia.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.300
It's true.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.510
I am terribly sorry.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:33.210
In the middle of a soirée... 
in front of all those people...

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.950
Of all the times to...

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.030
Algard!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:40.500
What in the world were you thinking?!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:47.020
Lady Euphyllia...

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.970
I'm sorry, Grantz. It seems 
my judgment was premature.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.520
Not at all.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.430
Euphyllia.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.900
I had heard that you and the prince 
had not grown any closer.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.980
Yes.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:09.420
It is unfortunate that it ended this way.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.880
I am... very sorry.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.830
No need to apologize.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:19.280
What you need to think about now 
is what you will do from here.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.250
How shall I be punished?

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:28.430
What Euphyllia does from here, eh?

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:31.350
That's it, Father!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.910
That's the great idea 
I came to share with you!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.760
Great idea, you say?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.720
Father, Duke Grantz...

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:44.070
Please give Lady Euphyllia to me!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.730
I'll do everything in my 
power to make her happy!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.710
W...

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.150
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:58.120
What kind of ridiculous 
joke are you making?!

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.830
I'm being completely serious, Father.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.390
That's even more frightening!

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.290
What, so either way would be wrong?

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.770
You're the one who's wrong!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.440
What I'm saying is...

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:14.890
I want to welcome Lady 
Euphyllia as my assistant!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.090
Me... as your assistant?

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:22.430
<i>S-So cute...</i>

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:26.530
<i>Those puppy-dog eyes must be 
some sort of magic on their own!</i>

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.450
<i>Her entire existence is OP!</i>

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.220
Th-The problem here is not that 
the engagement was annulled,

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.220
but that he declared it publicly.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.640
Correct?

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.360
Well, yes...

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:50.040
Since so many people heard it, 
we can't take it back.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:54.530
If you want to arrange an engagement for a 
lady who's already been spurned by royalty,

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.400
your choice of potential partners is limited.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.920
And as brilliant as Euphyllia is,

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:02.340
I can't just haphazardly hand 
her off to some foreign nation.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.060
After all, Lady Euphyllia...

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.650
is loved by the spirits!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:12.120
They say she commands more magical 
attributes than anyone in history.

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:18.140
And she excels in both etiquette 
and the martial arts! She's a genius!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.550
She's the Kingdom of Palettia's treasure!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.050
The best of the best!

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.880
And above all...

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.430
She's beautiful <i>and</i> cute!

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:39.300
However, this matter has left a 
stain on her life as a noble lady.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.570
So when you say you want her as your 
assistant, you mean in magicology?

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:53.510
The study of magical science that I advocate,

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.540
"magicology," will, in my opinion, 
bring about a new of technology.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.260
Well, yes...

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:04.780
It is certainly progressive 
and full of unknown potential.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.360
Exactly!

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.950
If shared with the public,

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.880
it could greatly impact the entire kingdom.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:16.840
But you have refrained from 
announcing it to the masses.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.480
I don't really like taking center stage.

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:22.070
I just want to immerse 
myself in my research.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.510
I see. In other words,

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.980
you want your achievements 
in magicology to be...

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:31.540
Precisely, Duke Grantz!

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:35.480
Why not have Lady Euphyllia announce 
the results of our joint research

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.910
to restore her damaged reputation?

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.860
M-Me?!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:41.750
It could, if nothing else,

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.090
give people something besides the 
broken engagement to talk about.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.540
Right?!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:51.510
But... me as your assistant?

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:55.480
There's plenty that I stand 
to gain from this deal, too.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.900
Given the way I am,

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:02.390
my reputation is so bad that 
I can't hire a skilled assistant.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.840
But that's...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.010
But you are incredibly talented,

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:10.810
and you'd be the perfect choice 
to promote magicology to the masses.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:15.270
But wouldn't I be taking 
all the credit for your work?

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:16.990
Nah.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.960
I'm just doing it out of love!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.080
For magicology, you mean?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:23.840
Yep!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.620
It'll change the world we live in.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.550
It's new technology, packed 
with dreams and romanticism!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:38.170
And if possible, I really want
you to fall in love, too.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.020
Y-You're referring to magicology, right?!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:49.020
Do you remember what you once said to me?

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:53.740
Oh, you mean what she said when 
she renounced her right to the throne?

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.810
Father?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:00.090
A long time ago, Princess Anisphia said...

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.150
Father!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.540
Hmm? What is it?

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.320
I don't want to marry a man!

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.550
If I fall in love,

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:11.750
I want it to be with a woman!

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:13.970
Are you just making various excuses

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:17.930
when all you really want 
is to make Euphyllia your own?

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:25.510
Th-That's not... totally wrong, 
but... I mean...

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.600
I don't want to accidentally 
get pregnant or anything...

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:33.190
What is <i>wrong</i> with you?!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.140
How dare you speak of such an 
important royal duty in that way?!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.500
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.100
You're gonna crush your 
precious princess's head!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:46.080
It would match your twisted 
disposition perfectly!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:50.900
What's the point in passing my genes 
along when I can't even use magic?!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.970
It's not about having any point!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:55.180
Do you not understand a father's 
desire to see his daughter's child?!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.710
I feel so hopeless, I could cry!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.420
Well, I'm already crying! 
Bawling like a baby!

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.730
You haven't shed a single tear!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.860
Can we just say I understand now?!

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:08.100
Is this how a parent and child should be?

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.560
Father?

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.540
I'm sorry, Euphyllia.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.090
F-Father?

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:40.800
Grantz... bowed his head!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.840
You have worked hard to avoid 
shaming the Magenta household.

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:50.730
I believed that encouraging you to 
that end was my job as your father.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.930
Wh-What are you saying?

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:58.240
I now feel that I may have been mistaken.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.810
I'm who I am today because of 
the education you've given me!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.570
This was all my own fault!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:11.190
Because I am insufficient as a duke's 
daughter, and as a future queen...

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:13.470
I'm a fool who has besmirched 
the name of our—

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.720
No daughter of mine

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.710
is a fool.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.770
You lived up to all my expectations.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.390
Too well, in fact.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.840
I've begun to question whether what 
<i>you</i> wanted played any part in it.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.300
Please stop.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:36.300
I really haven't... I'm all right...

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.010
I'm sure I haven't been 
a very good father...

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.220
or even a good person.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.210
You don't need to worry about our family.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.830
If there's something you want,

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.550
I'll make it happen, even if 
it pits me against the king.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.450
Euphyllia...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.910
Would becoming queen be too much for you?

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.420
Was this really the right thing to do?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.390
The princess's villa is an ideal 
place for her to lay low.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:47.390
And her proposal of joint magicology 
research is worth considering.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.350
Besides...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.400
Besides?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:54.300
Even if Euphyllia were to be plundered,

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.530
that might not be so bad.

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:57.860
Grantz!

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.160
I was joking.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:05.440
But there may be meaning in giving 
Euphyllia to Princess Anisphia.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.410
What do you mean?

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:12.090
No law says that there is only one 
path to succeeding the throne.

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:17.330
Should a prime minister 
be saying that to a king?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.710
I thought we were supposed to be 
speaking as friends right now.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.070
Princess Anisphia could be the 
next ruler of this kingdom.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.400
It's not such a bad dream to have, is it?

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.880
That's not a dream I ever want to have.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.230
It's just a nightmare.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.150
Are you curious about that?

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:49.320
It's a Thermal Pot,
made with a fire spirit stone!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.370
Did you invent it?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.450
It's set to maintain a given temperature,

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.620
so it can have tea ready in no time.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.260
It can be used for bathwater, as well.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:02.570
I can even wash dishes without 
having the water go cold.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.530
Please try some.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:10.960
I see.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.020
It is indeed delicious.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:14.420
Thank you for saying so.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.390
That's very convenient.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.140
It seems as though it could 
have many other uses, as well.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.590
Right? You totally get it!

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:24.750
I guess those who get it... really get it.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:28.260
Oh, hey! Since you're here, 
come see my workshop!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.570
Huh?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.620
If you're gonna be my assistant, 
you should get a feel for the place first!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.800
But, Princess Anisphia...

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.760
You can call me "Anis."

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.960
Oh, and I'll call you "Euphie"!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.710
We're not strangers anymore, after all!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.110
Er... H-Huh?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.920
There's no stopping Miss Anis at this point.

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:55.780
Just think of it as being bewitched 
by a demon and give up.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.300
Let's go, Euphie!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.910
Anis, wai—

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.640
Hang on tight!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:13.150
Welcome to my workshop!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.760
There are so many things 
I've never seen before...

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.570
You made all these, Princess Anisph—

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.330
I mean, Miss Anis?

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.040
That's right! Praise me, Euphie!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.510
W-Well done.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:32.970
Please don't spoil Miss Anis too much.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.660
The tools themselves are remarkable,

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:42.970
but I'm shocked that you even had 
the idea to use spirit stones.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:47.180
Oh, well, it's spirits that make 
the use of magic possible, right?

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:50.510
But I can't even sense spirits at all,

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.390
so I can't use magic.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.690
I had no idea...

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:00.270
So I had to think of something 
that could replace the spirits!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.770
You truly are amazing, Miss Anis.

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:09.760
I've always taken the existence 
of magic and spirits for granted.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.580
I never even considered why 
they work the way they do.

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.350
It's good that you never 
had to think about it.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:18.890
Since you're compatible with 
so many different spirits,

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.560
you're OP enough to use 
any attribute you want.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.520
OP?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.530
The truth is...

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:31.470
I actually envy people who can 
use magic. Just a little bit.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.940
Um...

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.530
Because as a princess who can't use magic,

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:40.030
Miss Anis is the very definition 
of a useless royal.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.710
Disrespect! Pure disrespect! 
Off with your head!

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.670
How could you say such a thing?!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.420
In the Kingdom of Palettia,

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.350
it is said that those who formed 
contracts with greater spirits

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:53.260
were the primogenitors of the royal 
and noble families, is it not?

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.330
Yeah, but... I know, but...

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.600
Which means the current royalty and nobility

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:01.650
are qualified to be as such 
by the authority of magic.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.570
Miss Anis, on the other hand...

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.240
Yeah, but...

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:08.810
Magic tools have even more 
potential than magic itself!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.630
You just don't get it at all, Ilia!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:15.490
<i>If something equivalent to magic could be 
used to give the people more freedom...</i>

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:15.490
We're not talking about something more 
than magic. We're talking about magic.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:19.540
But you use the Thermal Pot, too!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>How would the very conservative nobles 
feel about their loss of authority?</i>

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:25.670
What's that supposed to mean?! 
I won't let you use it anymore!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:25.080
<i>This young woman will prove to be a 
powerful medicine for this kingdom.</i>

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.760
Lady Euphyllia?

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:29.610
Um, it's nothing...

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.800
Well, it's late, so we're done for today,

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:37.810
but to celebrate your arrival here, 
I'll make you a special magic tool!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.760
For me?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.330
Look forward to it!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.430
Miss Anis, please stop!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:52.680
This stuff's hard to take off 
alone, isn't it? So I'll help!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:53.810
Wait...

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.680
You can borrow some of my pajamas.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.050
Thank you...

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.680
Now please go over there.

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:19.630
Come join me, my lady.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:23.090
I was just kidding! I won't do anything!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.000
Please excuse me.

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.760
Thanks for coming with me today.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.300
I know a lot has happened,

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.200
but I hope you'll see the appeal 
of magicology and myself soon.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:48.120
Yes... You are just as crazy 
as the rumors say...

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.080
And even more mysterious.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.810
Just... what are you?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.720
What... do you mean?

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.190
Just from what happened today, I can tell

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:05.790
that you are very clever, 
and that you have big dreams.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.900
I'm sure you're capable of living 
more freely than anyone else.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:15.370
So why did you help me?

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:19.670
Someone like me, who wasn't 
even your friend...

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.660
I had lots of reasons.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.250
Part of it was that I like you, 
and part of it was self-interest.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:32.990
But the biggest reason was 
because you're perfect.

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.960
Um...

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:39.520
You've always been calm and 
in control of your emotions.

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.830
Even after what happened at the soirée,

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.240
you still tried to remain 
strong and righteous.

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:49.800
You really are the perfect duke's daughter.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:53.070
I guess that's why I just 
couldn't leave you alone.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:58.060
I don't understand. You can't leave 
me alone because I'm perfect?

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:05.670
If you're someone who can smile on 
your own, you can do what you want.

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:10.790
But it didn't look like you were 
able to do that as you are now.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:20.590
If I really am as free as you say,

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:25.370
then I just can't help reaching out 
to someone who lacks that freedom.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.940
And that was your only reason for...

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:34.930
It may seem like a trivial thing, 
but it's very important to me.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:42.600
Magicians should use their 
magic to make others smile.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:48.320
You've worked so hard.

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.990
Just rest now, Euphie.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.540
Goodnight.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.970
Episode Two

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Episode Three
